,"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":15,"created_at":"2025-05-13T13:22:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:31Z","closed_at":"2026-02-05T20:52:36Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106352","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106352.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106352.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-05T20:52:36Z"},"body":"Made in response to #106335. For Quaternions, it's better to display more digits in the inspector for precision, beyond the usual float step found in the editor settings in `\"interface/inspector/default_float_step\"`. Note that property hints can still override the step to a different value, this change only overrides the editor setting.\r\n\r\nThis PR also adjusts the `EditorSpinSlider` code to clamp the step used for dragging to a minimum of 0.001. Without this change, clicking and dragging on Quaternion elements becomes very slow. I didn't even test double precision, but imagine how slow that would be too. This may affect editor plugins that expect this behavior, but I don't think it's good behavior. It's bad to discourage users from using high precision because the usability is worse. Perhaps there needs to be separate settings for drag step and the actual number step, but that's a larger proposal...\r\n\r\n_Bugsquad Edited:_\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98090","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106352/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106352/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}